SUMMARY:🎄 Christmas with Amy Steinberg! 🎶✨
DESCRIPTION:Center for Spiritual Living Asheville\n# 🎄 Christmas with A
 my Steinberg! 🎶✨\n\n**Friday\\\, December 25\\\, 2026 \\| 7:00 PM**\n
 \nIt's back! Join us for a very special Christmas evening with the fabulou
 s **Amy Steinberg**! ❤️\n\nCelebrate the light and love of the season 
 with an uplifting evening filled with **music\, laughter\, joy\, and a lit
 tle holiday magic!** ✨\n\nAmy brings her unique blend of soulful music\,
  humor\, heart\, and inspiration to create an experience that will leave y
 ou smiling and feeling uplifted.\n\nAnd if Christmas sometimes feels a lit
 tle lonely\, this is an especially wonderful opportunity to get out\, conn
 ect with others\, and share the warmth of the season in a welcoming commun
 ity. You don't have to spend Christmas alone! 💖\n\nBring your friends\,
  invite someone who could use a little holiday cheer\, and come celebrate 
 with us!\n\n🎵 **EVENT DETAILS**\n\n* 📅 Friday\, December 25\, 2026\n
 * 🕖 7:00 PM\n* 📍 Center for Spiritual Living Asheville\n* ❤️ $20
 –$30 Suggested Love Offering\n\nWhether you're looking for holiday inspi
 ration\, great music\, laughter\, or simply some good company on Christmas
  evening\, we'd love to celebrate with you!\n\n🌟 **Let's make this Chri
 stmas a celebration of light\, love\, music\, and connection!**\n\n#Christ
 masWithAmySteinberg #AmySteinberg #ChristmasInAsheville #LiveMusic #Commun
 ityCommonsAsheville #CenterForSpiritualLivingAsheville #HolidayJoy
